{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37823","headline":"赠咸阳王主簿 · 郑谷","name":"赠咸阳王主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可爱咸阳王主簿，穷经尽到昔贤心。\n登科未足酬多学，执卷犹闻惜寸阴。\n自与山妻舂斗粟，祗凭邻叟典孤琴。\n我来赊酒相留宿，听我披衣看雪吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37823.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37823","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}